The **Modern** theme is a contemporary archive theme built around large images and a card-based layout. It's ideal for visual newsletters where each post benefits from a prominent cover image and plenty of breathing room.

- [Live preview](https://demo.buttondown.com/css-weekly/archive/css-weekly-10-css-in-js-vs-utility-first-css/)
- [Source CSS](https://github.com/buttondown/themes/blob/main/themes/modern/assets/styles.css)

You can switch to the Modern theme—and tweak any of the settings below—from your [archive settings](https://buttondown.com/settings/archives).

